{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"i\": 1,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"H2中似曾相识的亲切与真实发生过的短暂温暖，加上H15中的怀念与舍不得，足以支撑记忆感重新浮现这一局部心理过程，没有补出具体往事或外部事件。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 2,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"坚持、不甘、委屈以及认真无法保证结果的因果关系，都接在H4、H7、H15、H16和M5已经确立的历史上，没有改变主线。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 3,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"身体因连续加力而难以维持强度、退下来后脆弱显露，直接承接H8、H12和H18；旋律单独显露只是听感定位，心理原因仍是此前的消耗。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 4,\n      \"label\": \"越界\",\n      \"why\": \"“几次深呼吸般的松动带来短暂的释放”把音乐段落的松动直接写成心理释放的来源，越过了不得将音乐变化直接当作心理原因的边界；其余关于反复担忧、依恋与持续加力导致耗竭的因果均有H14、H17和H18支撑。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"四条已经串起从亲近与珍惜、坚持却无法保证结果，到反复担忧和身心耗竭的连续心理过程，即使不看听感记录，也能读懂情绪主线，尽管所珍惜对象的具体所指仍未交代。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d3256cc9-9ae3-458f-85b7-9f2d70961619", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T144622103622Z", "elapsed_seconds": 431.594, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T14:53:33.715495+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b808d0ff1949097558ee4252a63254cff743c5c80ec085e827be5c1fc8ae9e24", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false